g":0,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":null,"creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":0,"freeCount":0,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":6068961298,"name":"[🐸TOAD SAGE 🐸 & ⚡YELLOW FLASH⚡] Anime Impact","desc":"📱💻🎮 You can play on any device. (CONSOLE, PC, MOBILE) \n⚡Collect new unique characters in your adventure! \n⚔️Lead your units into battle with a unique system! \n⛩️Upgrade your units for amazing skills! \n\n🔷Join the ROBLOX Group for +10% EXP in-game!🔷 \n💎Premium & VIP users receive 2x rewards in AFK Realm.💎 \n\nJoin our community server at the social links below for codes and information.\n\nControls\n-- Keyboard\nSprint = Left Shift\nConfirm Selection = Spacebar\nQuick Cycle = Middle Mouse Button\nTarget Cycle Left = A\nTarget Cycle Right = D\nCancel Action = Right Click\nFlashstep = Q\nPass = C\nAuto = X\nBlock = V\n\n-- Console\nSprint = Left Joystick (DOWN)\nConfirm Selection = A/X\nQuick Cycle = Right Joystick (DOWN)\nTarget Cycle Left = LB/L1\nTarget Cycle Right = RB/R1\nCancel Action = Right Click\nFlashstep/Cancel Action = Left Joystick (DOWN)\nPass = Dpad Up\nAuto = Dpad Down\nBlock = B/Circle\nCursor = Select","path":"/game/6068961298-anime-impact","slug":"6068961298-anime-impact","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/7bde8207896ae61ca5441da7615466f0d9c099d666ba5feca3f1a2b4cab90d0a.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-55a5d89ad480619796c1c86c9b2ade08/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":12803567,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-06-29T13:26:43.066Z","creator":{"name":"Paragon Command","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":5357899168,"name":"Dinosaur Arcade [BETA]","desc":"🔥 Updates will drop every Friday at 11am US EST!\n📢 Next code will be added in at 55k Likes!\n\nWelcome to Dinosaur Arcade! Return to the Mesozoic Era and experience the world as your favorite dinosaur, visualized in an arcade style aesthetic! Search the map for fossil deposits to research new dinosaurs, investigate meteor impact sites, and uncover the secrets of the mayhem!\n\n🎮 PC/XBOX Controls\n[Left-Click], [RT] - Interact\n[Right-Click], [RB] - Grab\n[Shift], [LT] - Sprint\n[Q/E], [Y/B] - Swim Up/Down\n[C], [Left Stick] - Call\n[G], [DPadRight] - Growl\n[R], [DPadUp] - Roar\n[Z], [DPadDown]  - Rest\n[T], [LB] - Track footprints while hovering over with your cursor\n[U], [X] - Hide GUI\n[H], [DPadLeft] - Change camera view\n[Space], [A] - Jump\n\nGroup: https://www.roblox.com/groups/10549310/Dinosaur-Arcade#!/about","path":"/game/5357899168-dinosaur-arcade","slug":"5357899168-dinosaur-arcade","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/86fd6065a414dcb70dc713ef7beffc07f9bd372d11b56f452d2fbf511a0af213.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-bc4a4c8d0b5e91e5bb4a200755bd8043/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":19321997,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-07-11T21:13:19.822Z","creator":{"name":"ChickenEngineer","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":5901548022,"name":"SMALL UPDATE Try To Die (read description) ","desc":" 🎉  THE BIG UPDATE IS HERE! 🎉 \r\n 🔨  Update Log  31st Ausgust 2022\r\n ✨ Features:\r\n⭐   - 25 New Levels\r\n📁 - Progress saving is here!\r\n💨  - SpeedrunMode added\r\n💀 - Dead effects added\r\n📜  - Don't forget our credits (Level 0)\r\n🎮 - Console support\r\n🛠️  - Bunch of Bug Fixes\r\nThank you for your patience! Sorry for being so late; But we're still in August hehe ;)\r\n\r\nSHUTDOWN = PROBABLY BUG FIXES\r\nIf you have any suggestion/feedback please let me know via sending a message on my profile\r\n(For those who are looking for the community server, it got deleted for some reason).\r\n\r\nYou are free to copy this game and make your own Try To Die; I'm even thinking about uncopylocking it.\r\nThis game was originally called Try To Oof.","path":"/game/5901548022-small-update-try-to-die","slug":"5901548022-small-update-try-to-die","thumbnail":{